    "// Services",
    "Sustainability in open source is about more than money. OSE supports projects with resources, documentation, and a network of peers and funders. By joining OSE, your project connects to tools and people that build long-term impact.",
    "Read more",
    "// Services",
    "Handling donations and grants can be one of the hardest parts of running an open source project. OSE offers fiscal hosting: a simple way to receive funds, stay compliant, and share resources transparently — without creating a legal entity. That way, your project stays focused on code, not paperwork.",
    "Read more",
    "// Services",
    "Reimbursing contributors, processing invoices, and staying compliant takes energy away from coding. OSE acts as your financial back office: no paperwork jungle, just a simple, human process that lets your project stay focused on development.",
    "Read more",
    "Start in minutes. No paperwork. No barriers. Just open source, sustained.",
